{"type":"message_update","assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"thinking_end","contentIndex":0,"content":"Good, now I understand the ingestion process. I need to:\n1. Create build scripts in `.xorq/scripts/` for both datasets\n2. Build them with `xorq build`\n3. Add them to the catalog with `xorq catalog add`\n4. Then create a derived metric script that joins both and calculates the per-capita rate\n5. Verify the final value\n\nSince this involves two datasets (farmers markets by state and census population), I'll need to create:\n1. A script to ingest the farmers markets data\n2. A script to ingest the census data\n3. A script that joins both and creates the per-capita metric\n\nLet me start by creating the scripts directory and the build scripts."}}
